---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site title="首页">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="who">高嘉隆 · 独立站运营</p>
        <h1><span>写跨境，</span><span>也写修学。</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">三年独立站运营经验，负责过全店 GMV。我帮独立站卖家梳理广告浪费，也为一人公司和小团队提供运营陪跑。</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/services/">看服务 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/cross-border/">看笔记 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <div class="art-frame">
          <img src="/study-desk.webp" alt="窗边的书桌上有一本打开的笔记、念珠和一台电脑，远处是群山" width="1100" height="733" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
        <figcaption>工作与修学，同一张书桌。本站插画。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-notes" aria-labelledby="home-notes-title">
    <h2 id="home-notes-title">笔记</h2>
    <div class="home-note-grid">
      <a href="/cross-border/">
        <h3>跨境笔记</h3>
        <p>从独立站运营、广告投放到 AI 一人公司。</p>
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/practice/">
        <h3>修学笔记</h3>
        <p>净土与唯识的专题摘录和待研讨问题。</p>
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
